      <title>特斯拉Diner：名厨离席，业务模式巨变，5万汉堡能否“撑起”万亿估值？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251118-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89diner%E5%90%8D%E5%8E%A8%E7%A6%BB%E5%B8%AD%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E5%B7%A8%E5%8F%985%E4%B8%87%E6%B1%89%E5%A0%A1%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E6%92%91%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E4%BC%B0%E5%80%BC/</link>
